# Files under web/ that must NOT be uploaded as static assets.
#
# Everything in this directory is served, which is easy to forget because the
# two config files here are not: Workers consumes `_headers` and `_redirects`
# itself, so they answer 404 and give the false impression that anything
# non-HTML is safe. `README.md` was served for a day at
# https://written-stl.com/README.md — 12KB of deployment notes, the Google
# scope justifications, the demo-video plan, and the paragraph saying the beta
# syncs Spotify while the privacy policy deliberately omits it.
#
# Syntax is .gitignore's. Anything added under web/ that is notes rather than
# site belongs here in the same commit.

README.md

# Excluded by Workers already; listed so a future reader does not have to
# know that to be sure.
.assetsignore

# wrangler keeps its scratch files here when run from inside web/; a
# sourcemap for its no-op worker was published from here on 2026-09-06.
.wrangler
